/// What a living entity shows the players near it besides its sounds: the dust it throws up
/// landing, an entity event, `broadcastEntityEvent`, as 54, honey slid on, 55, its hands swapped,
/// and 67, air run out; a chicken's egg, which the server drops; the slots of its equipment that
/// changed, each with what's in it now, `ClientboundSetEquipmentPacket`; and a particle the server
/// sends.
pub enum Shown {
    Dust(FallDust)
    Particle(Sent)
    Event(i8)
    /// An entity event of another entity, by its ID, as a villager breeding shows its partner's
    /// in its own tick (CAL-160).
    EventOf((i32, i8))
    Laid(Laid)
    Worn(List<(usize, Tag?)>)
    /// What a sheep's eating does to the level, which mob griefing lets it do, and what a farm
    /// animal's breeding asks of it (CAL-158).
    Grazed(Grazed)
    Bred(Bred)
    /// A hurt in its own tick that took the whole of it, by the damage type's ID, whose damage
    /// event goes to those who see it; a death in its own tick, what its level does of it; and
    /// what Calcite doesn't do yet that it would have, to be said (D424).
    Damaged(i32)
    Died(Death)
    Missing(String)
    /// Its way through a nether portal, which its level takes it on (D578).
    Travel(Travel)
    /// An end gateway it went into, at its place, whose cooldown its level begins, its block
    /// event where the walk's cursor ended; and the way one took it within its level (D594).
    Gateway(((i32, i32, i32), (i32, i32, i32)))
    /// The boxes of an ender dragon's head, neck and body where it would break what it flies
    /// into, which its level checks in turn as it has them then, `checkWalls` (D614).
    Walls(List<Aabb>)
    /// An ender dragon's strikes on the players its wings and head reach in its tick, in turn,
    /// which its level deals, `knockBack` and `hurt` (D615).
    Beaten(List<Beat>)
    /// An ender dragon's breath, the cloud it leaves at its place, owned by the dragon of its
    /// UUID, which its level makes and the dragon keeps, `DragonSittingFlamingPhase` (D617); and
    /// that cloud, by entity ID, gone as its breath ends, `end`.
    Breathed(((f64, f64, f64), (i64, i64)))
    Quenched(i32)
    /// An ender dragon's word to its dragon fight, whose dragon it is, `updateDragon`: its health
    /// over its most, which its fight's boss bar shows, its fight's count since it last saw it
    /// none again, and its name on the bar where it's given one (D626); and its death's end, which
    /// its fight hears of, `setDragonKilled` (D627).
    DragonSeen(f32)
    DragonKilled
    /// An ender dragon's strafe's fireball, from where it starts, along the way it's shot, owned
    /// by the dragon of its UUID, which its level makes and adds, `DragonStrafePlayerPhase` (D619).
    FireballShot(((f64, f64, f64), (f64, f64, f64), (i64, i64)))
    Moved(GatewayMove)
    /// A slime's split as it's taken out dying, what its level makes of it (D430).
    Split(Split)
    /// Redstone ore it stepped on, at its place, which its level lights (D431).
    Lit((i32, i32, i32))
    /// A wooden button an arrow went into, at its place, which its level presses (CAL-159).
    Pressed((i32, i32, i32))
    /// What it wears in a slot worn by so much, which its level does with its random,
    /// `hurtAndBreak`, as the sun wears an undead mob's helmet (D437).
    Wore((usize, i32))
    /// An armor stand's breaking, what its level does of it, `StandBreak` (D441).
    StandBroken(StandBreak)
    /// A mob's swing of a hand, by `InteractionHand`'s ID, with its `SwingAnimation`, its type's ID
    /// and its ticks, sent those who see it; and its attack on the player of an entity ID,
    /// `doHurtTarget`, which its level deals, with where the mob was as it attacked, in its goal's
    /// tick, before it moved, the damage's place (CAL-159).
    Swung((i32, i32, i32))
    Attack((i32, f64, f64, f64))
    /// A level event at a block, `levelEvent`: its kind, the block and its data (CAL-159).
    Level((i32, i32, i32, i32, i32))
    /// An enderman's take of the block at a place and its leave of what it carries at one, which
    /// its level does, `EndermanTakeBlockGoal` and `EndermanLeaveBlockGoal` (CAL-159).
    Took((i32, i32, i32))
    Left((i32, i32, i32))
    /// A villager's door at a place opened or shut, `DoorBlock.setOpen`, which its level does as
    /// its brain's tick stops for it (CAL-160).
    Door((i32, i32, i32, bool))
    /// A villager's offers priced again for the player trading with it, `updateSpecialPrices`,
    /// which they're sent, what their menu's payments buy made again (CAL-160).
    Repriced
    /// Farmland at a place it trampled, as it landed on it, `FarmlandBlock.fallOn`, which its level
    /// turns to dirt where mob griefing lets it, `turnToBaseBlock` (CAL-160).
    Trampled((i32, i32, i32))
    /// A bed at a place it lay down in, or got up from, `OCCUPIED` set and updated,
    /// `setBlockAndUpdate`, which its level does (CAL-160).
    Bed((i32, i32, i32, bool))
    /// A villager's harvest of the ripe crop at a place, `destroyBlock` with its drops, which its
    /// level breaks as its brain's tick stops for it; its seed planted at one, the crop's state set
    /// and updated, `setBlockAndUpdate`; and a crop grown at one by its bone meal, set with flags 2
    /// (CAL-160).
    Harvested((i32, i32, i32))
    Planted((i32, i32, i32, u32))
    Grew((i32, i32, i32, u32))
    /// A villager's offers asked for where they're still to make, `getOffers`, which the level
    /// makes as its trade set has them, at the place it was then, and updates the demand of so
    /// many times, `updateDemand`, as it did them as they were made (CAL-160).
    Offers((f64, f64, f64, i32))
    /// A mob's shot, `performRangedAttack`, whose arrow its level makes (CAL-159).
    Fired(Fired)
    /// A witch's throw of a splash potion, which its level makes and adds (D528).
    Hurled(Hurled)
    /// What a mob that picked up something better drops of what it had, which its level makes;
    /// and its pickup of so many of the item of an entity ID, `take`, which those who see the item
    /// are told (CAL-159).
    Spilled(Spilled)
    /// What an eye of ender that survives leaves as its life runs out, its stack where it was,
