    Survived(Spilled)
    Picked((i32, i32))
    /// What a villager throws to another, which its level makes, its motion as it's thrown; and
    /// its composter at a place set to a state, `setBlockAndUpdate`, ticked 20 on where a layer
    /// filled it to 7, `addLayer` (CAL-160).
    Tossed(Tossed)
    Composted((i32, i32, i32, u32, bool))
    /// An arrow's hits on the entities its way met this step, the nearest first, which its level
    /// deals before its tick goes on (CAL-159).
    Shot(List<ArrowHit>)
    /// The block an arrow struck, what it does of it, `onProjectileHit`, which its level deals
    /// before the arrow lands (CAL-159).
    Struck(BlockStruck)
    /// What a thrown potion hit, which its level splashes, `onHit`, before its removal's sent
    /// (D527).
    Splashed(Splash)
    /// What an ender pearl hit, which its level deals, its owner taken there, `onHit`, before its
    /// removal's sent (D579).
    Pearled(PearlHit)
    /// What a dragon fireball hit, which its level deals, its cloud left there, `onHit`, before
    /// its removal's sent (D618).
    Fireballed(FireballHit)
    /// What an area effect cloud's pass doses, which its level gives them, before its removal's
    /// sent where it went (D529).
    Dosed(Dose)
    /// The block an end crystal in a level with a dragon fight is in, which its level sets alight
    /// where it's air, `BaseFireBlock.getState` (D589).
    Kindled((i32, i32, i32))
    /// A spear's hits on what its use met this tick, `damageEntities`, which its level deals
    /// before the user's tick goes on (CAL-159).
    Stabbed(List<Stab>)
    /// Experience its level gives where it is, so much of it, `ExperienceOrb.award`; and a level
    /// event every player's sent, `globalLevelEvent`: its kind, the block and its data, as an
    /// ender dragon's death has them (D608).
    Awarded((f64, f64, f64, i32))
    Global((i32, i32, i32, i32, i32))
    /// Primed TNT's explosion as its fuse runs out, which its level makes, `PrimedTnt.explode`
    /// (CAL-182).
    Blew(Blast)
    /// A creeper's explosion as its fuse runs out, which its level makes before its tick goes on,
    /// `Creeper.explodeCreeper` (CAL-182).
    Exploded(Creep)
}

